item-desc-airlock = A powered door. It opens for anyone until someone bolts it.
item-desc-armor-vest = A padded vest that takes the edge off a blow to the torso.
item-desc-helmet-sec = A hard hat with a visor, the kind that keeps a skull in one piece.
item-desc-pistol-9mm = A compact sidearm chambered in 9mm. Takes a magazine.
item-desc-fire-axe = A heavy axe with a blade meant for doors and whatever stands behind them.
item-desc-shotgun-pump = A pump-action shotgun fed with shells one at a time.
item-desc-toolbox = A steel box that holds tools, or whatever else fits.
item-desc-backpack = A canvas bag with room for most things.
item-desc-riot-shield = A tower of polycarbonate. Raised, it eats whatever comes at your front until it cracks.
item-desc-crowbar = A length of steel bent for prying. Also for hitting.
item-desc-id-card = A plastic card with a photo and a name.
item-desc-stun-baton = A security baton with a shock cell. Each jolt puts someone on the floor and drains the cell.
item-desc-bola = Three weights on a cord. Thrown well, it tangles a runner's legs.
item-desc-pinata-bat = A party stick. Hits do little, but twice the coins fall out.
item-desc-katana = A curved blade that cuts fast and often.
item-desc-whitehole-grenade = Light it and step back: everything nearby is flung outward.
item-desc-singularity-grenade = Light it and step back: everything nearby is pulled to it.
item-desc-mousetrap = Set it, put it down, and the first foot on it is on the floor.
item-desc-energy-sword = A hilt. Switched on it is a blade that cuts almost anything.
item-desc-vampire-knife = A knife that drinks. Half of what it shakes loose is yours.
item-desc-teleport-gun = Whoever the bolt hits trades places with you.
item-desc-random-gun = Every pull is a surprise, for both of you.
item-desc-throngler = A blade too big to be sensible. Sweeps all around, slowly.
